      "language": "english",
      "review": "I got gifted this by my lovely partner, and I genuinely believe this is an extremely good game.\r\n\r\nThe story is interesting, each character's individual deal is cool (except wyll. you kind of smell), and the game is visually beautiful, and ran fine. In my full playthrough, I only really experienced one bug (that being an NPC began flickering in and out of existence mid-combat).\r\nMy first playthrough took me about 80 hours, but to be honest, I don't regret a minute of it. Except the Temple of Shar puzzles. God. They were my sole motivation to entirely go against Shar in every concieivable way.",
