      "language": "english",
      "review": "What amazing and cool game, until you play it and find one HUGE problem with it. THE WORST JANK ON PLANET ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ EARTH. Between unwanted movement, awkward camera control. absolute destructive unbalanced rolls. This game DESPERATELY wishes to be what D&D is and fails HORRIBLY. Whoever you hired to balance this game needs to not only be fired but literally bared from game design or programming in general. I mean seriously even with the difficult at min and on top of that proficiency slider ALL THE WAY UP, I still find characters missing on 90% chances ALL OF THE TIME. Yes I know its up to chance but the problem is that IT FEELS LIKE ITS NOT, at least the dice FEEL real. I mean come on... is it really that hard to do basic math, how do toy screw something so simple???",
